						<h1>Sleep Semiology <br></h1>

						This website catalogues the <em>questionnaires content analyses</em> from different subfields of sleep medicine, led by the SANPSY (Univ. Bordeaux / CHU de Bordeaux, France), in collaboration with other French or international teams.

						<br>
						<br>
						<p align = "left"> <u>Contact:</u> jean-arthur.micoulaud-franchi [at] chu-bordeaux.fr & vpmartin [at] inria.fr</p> 
						<hr>

						<h2>Sleep disorders in patients with psychiatric disorders <br></h2>

						<h3>"Screening questionnaires for sleep disorders in patients with psychiatric disorders" </h3> Julien Coelho, Vincent P. Martin, Alexandre Richaud, Clélia Quiles, Pierre Philip, Jean-Arthur Micoulaud-Franchi 
						<br> L'Encéphale (2026)
						<br> <a href="https://doi.org/10.1016/j.encep.2026.03.001">https://doi.org/10.1016/j.encep.2026.03.001</a>
